From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 05:17:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/asahi: G16: bring to #1314's final revision

Bring to its revision in aurora-silicon/linux#1314:
commit 3a17608f7a42 ("drm/asahi: G16: ride out dark sensors while the
GPU is idle").
This tree carried an earlier revision:
commit 6dcb22bc028f ("drm/asahi: G16: ride out dark sensors while the
GPU is idle").
Only the difference between the two.

Based on 3a17608f7a42 from aurora-silicon/linux#1314
Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/glue.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/glue.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/glue.c
index 6b479e0a16..a07032a1b6 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/glue.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/glue.c
@@ -155,6 +155,9 @@ int asahi_g16_cooling_sample(struct asahi_g16_cooling *cooling, u64 now, bool id
 		   (idle || now - cooling->valid_ns < APPLE_PMP_GATED_HOLD_NS) &&
 		   cooling->valid_mc < APPLE_PMP_GATED_HOLD_MC) {
 		*temperature = cooling->valid_mc;
+		/* Idle makes no heat: the 2 s with work in flight start with the work. */
+		if (idle)
+			cooling->valid_ns = now;
 		ret = 0;
 	}
 	apple_pmp_cooling_sample(&cooling->policy, now, *temperature, ret);
-- 
